                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.20 Defense/6–2840: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Venezuela</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Scott</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-06-28T12:00:00-04:30">June 28,
                        1940—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received 12:45 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>94. After successful completion his mission Captain Canaga left by plane today,
                    due to arrive Washington June 30 morning.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Scott</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
